            <ArticleTitle>Intranasal sphenopalatine ganglion block: minimally invasive pharmacotherapy for refractory facial and headache pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>57-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Facial pain and headache of various etiologies are oftentimes unresponsive to conventional therapies. Transnasal sphenopalatine gangion block provides a safe, low-cost, therapy that, if effective, oftentimes can be self-administered for pain relief.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
